# ====================================================================
# Standalone Game Build Binaries Note:
# ====================================================================
# By default, standalone build files (flappybird.exe, flappybird_Data/, 
# UnityPlayer.dll, MonoBleedingEdge/) are NOT ignored so you can track
# this build if intended. 
# 
# If this repository should only track SOURCE code and NOT the ~98MB 
# compiled game build, uncomment the lines below:
#
# *.exe
# *.dll
# flappybird_Data/
# MonoBleedingEdge/
# D3D12/

